message:
{{#is_alert}}🔴 attack 5 分钟内出现超过 {{threshold}} 条 5xx 日志（当前 {{value}} 条）。
定位逻辑：battle 5xx 与本监控同时红 = attack 内部错误；仅 battle 红 = attack 挂掉/超时或 battle 自身问题。排查：Logs 搜 service:attack @http.status_code:[500 TO 599]，结合 dd.trace_id 跳转对应 trace。{{/is_alert}}
{{#is_recovery}}✅ attack 5xx 错误已恢复。{{/is_recovery}}

**排查（告警时段：触发前 15 分钟 ~ 触发后 5 分钟）：**
- [attack 5xx 日志](https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=service%3Aattack%20%40http.status_code%3A%5B500%20TO%20599%5D&from_ts={{eval "last_triggered_at_epoch-15*60*1000"}}&to_ts={{eval "last_triggered_at_epoch+5*60*1000"}}&live=false)
- [attack 5xx 请求记录（点开看火焰图）](https://us5.datadoghq.com/apm/traces?query=service%3Aattack%20env%3Aschool%20%40http.status_code%3A%3E%3D500&start={{eval "last_triggered_at_epoch-15*60*1000"}}&end={{eval "last_triggered_at_epoch+5*60*1000"}}&paused=true)
- [上游 battle 5xx 日志（判断是否连带影响）](https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=service%3Abattle%20%40http.status_code%3A%5B500%20TO%20599%5D&from_ts={{eval "last_triggered_at_epoch-15*60*1000"}}&to_ts={{eval "last_triggered_at_epoch+5*60*1000"}}&live=false)
